  "markup": "<div class=\"canvas-card\">\n    <div class=\"chrome-min\"><div class=\"l\">RESEARCH OBJECTIVES</div><div class=\"r\">05 / 19</div></div>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto auto 1fr;gap:2.8vh;flex:1;min-height:0\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"h-xl-zh\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">研究目的：建立设计与评估的双向闭环</h2>\n      </div>\n      \n      <p class=\"t-body\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary);margin:0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.45\">\n        本研究的根本目的在于解决传统非正式学习解说系统在信息捕获与行为引导上的效率瓶颈，提出一套具备实证支撑的视觉改良规范。\n      </p>\n\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2vw;align-items:stretch\">\n        <!-- Left block: Theory & Instrumentation -->\n        <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border-subtle);padding:2.5vh 2vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2.2vh;border-radius:6px\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n            <span style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:16px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700\">THEORY & TOOLS</span>\n            <i data-lucide=\"settings\" style=\"color:var(--accent);width:22px;height:22px\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.8vh\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5vh\">\n              <h3 class=\"t-h-prod\" style=\"margin:0;font-size:24px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600\">1. 理论框架产出</h3>\n              <p class=\"t-body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary);margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4\">\n                提炼共创设计洞察，产出 A/R/S（启发性氛围、观众关联性、结构清晰性）解说原则体系。\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5vh;border-top:1px solid var(--border-subtle);padding-top:1.5vh\">\n              <h3 class=\"t-h-prod\" style=\"margin:0;font-size:24px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600\">2. 开源工具链开发</h3>\n              <p class=\"t-body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary);margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4\">\n                研发低成本非接触式眼动追踪设备与漂移补偿算法，实现纸面二维坐标的高精度映射。\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right block: Verification -->\n        <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border-subtle);padding:2.5vh 2vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2.2vh;border-radius:6px\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n            <span style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:16px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700\">VERIFICATION</span>\n            <i data-lucide=\"shield-check\" style=\"color:var(--accent);width:22px;height:22px\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5vh\">\n            <h3 class=\"t-h-prod\" style=\"margin:0;font-size:24px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600\">3. 数据量化与实证</h3>\n            <p class=\"t-body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary);margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4\">\n              通过细粒度的 AOI 注意力配额与注视点动态转化机制，实证检验改良设计的视觉引导效能。\n            </p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:auto;background:var(--grey-1);padding:1.5vh 1.5vw;border-radius:4px\">\n            <span class=\"t-meta\" style=\"color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:14px;font-family:var(--mono);display:block;margin-bottom:0.5vh\">VALIDATION LOOP:</span>\n            <span class=\"t-meta\" style=\"color:var(--text-helper);font-size:14px\">Qualitative Insight → Quantitative Evidence</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
}
